# On-screen controls on the platform's own layout (TRAIL_DEBUG=town): the d-pad walks down the grid while the other
# thumb holds B (run), then MENU opens the start menu and B closes it. Touches go through the same hit testing as
# fingers (InputScript "touch"); used by the phone checks.
100 capture touch_start.png
110 touch 1 dpad 0 0.8
120 touch 2 cancel
180 lift 2
190 lift 1
210 tap 3 pause
250 capture touch_menu.png
270 tap 4 cancel
310 capture touch_end.png
330 quit
